  (text "Test points and mounting holes" (at 397.51 260.35 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2) (thickness 0.44) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3d317eed-6613-4daf-a70f-89f35c61c24c"))
  (text "Generated from design.py by generate_board.py - edit design.py, not this file." (at 20.32 448.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2c56a5ef-d88a-4250-b971-ca4a5dfaa32a"))
  (text "Magnet power switch: a magnet near U2 (SM351LT, always powered by U1, 3 uA) pulls HALL_OUT low -> Q4 drives" (at 20.32 452.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2784bd54-6943-46cb-9865-03c4a12797e6"))
  (text "LATCH_G high -> Q3 pulls the P-FET gates low -> the ESP32 boots and drives PWR_HOLD (GPIO32) high to stay on." (at 20.32 454.66 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "47c6b3d7-9829-41a3-ab4e-d5ca3f084a18"))
  (text "Shutdown = the firmware releases PWR_HOLD once the magnet is taken away. MAG_SENSE (GPIO15) reads the magnet." (at 20.32 458.47 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "74486145-02af-4a6e-9d5e-889c227d52a4"))
  (text "USB-C powers only the 3.3 V side (D5): the shore-station board needs nothing but a USB cable." (at 20.32 462.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b46fa9de-b1f0-4972-80f9-3239b295321b"))
  (text "All analog inputs are on ADC1 (GPIO34/35/36/39), which keeps working while Wi-Fi talks to the camera." (at 20.32 464.82 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "42cd7a10-684f-42b1-b717-2b938d92517c"))

